  user_input {
    user_response: "Create a modern, professional web application named **SkillBridge AI**.\n\nIt is an AI-powered career platform that helps students analyze their resumes, match their skills with job descriptions, and discover skills they need to improve.\n\nFor now, build ONLY the basic website layout.\n\nRequirements:\n- Use React and TypeScript.\n- Create a clean, modern SaaS design with a white background and indigo/violet accents.\n- Make the website responsive.\n- Add a top navigation bar with the SkillBridge AI logo, Home, Dashboard, and Analyze Resume.\n- Create a landing page with the heading \"Bridge Your Skills to Your Next Opportunity.\"\n- Add a short subtitle explaining the platform.\n- Add two buttons: \"Analyze My Resume\" and \"Explore Features.\"\n- Add three simple feature cards: AI Resume Analysis, Smart Job Matching, and Personalized Learning Roadmaps.\n- Add a simple footer.\n- Use reusable React components and clean code.\n- Use Lucide icons if available.\n- Make the navigation and buttons work wherever possible.\n- Do not implement AI, API integration, authentication, or database functionality yet.\n- Do not build additional pages or complicated features at this stage.\n\nFocus on a polished visual design and make sure the application runs without errors. Ensure the interface is responsive and maintains a consistent, modern aesthetic. Use a clean color palette and clear typography throughout the user interface. Additionally, use intuitive navigation patterns to improve user experience and accessibility. Finally, ensure the codebase is well-documented for future scaling."
    items {
      text: "Create a modern, professional web application named **SkillBridge AI**.\n\nIt is an AI-powered career platform that helps students analyze their resumes, match their skills with job descriptions, and discover skills they need to improve.\n\nFor now, build ONLY the basic website layout.\n\nRequirements:\n- Use React and TypeScript.\n- Create a clean, modern SaaS design with a white background and indigo/violet accents.\n- Make the website responsive.\n- Add a top navigation bar with the SkillBridge AI logo, Home, Dashboard, and Analyze Resume.\n- Create a landing page with the heading \"Bridge Your Skills to Your Next Opportunity.\"\n- Add a short subtitle explaining the platform.\n- Add two buttons: \"Analyze My Resume\" and \"Explore Features.\"\n- Add three simple feature cards: AI Resume Analysis, Smart Job Matching, and Personalized Learning Roadmaps.\n- Add a simple footer.\n- Use reusable React components and clean code.\n- Use Lucide icons if available.\n- Make the navigation and buttons work wherever possible.\n- Do not implement AI, API integration, authentication, or database functionality yet.\n- Do not build additional pages or complicated features at this stage.\n\nFocus on a polished visual design and make sure the application runs without errors. Ensure the interface is responsive and maintains a consistent, modern aesthetic. Use a clean color palette and clear typography throughout the user interface. Additionally, use intuitive navigation patterns to improve user experience and accessibility. Finally, ensure the codebase is well-documented for future scaling."
    }
  }
}
