  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Scope**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the scope for the **SkillBridge AI** web application. It\'s an AI-powered platform with a clear focus on helping students. My primary focus is on resume analysis, skill matching with job descriptions, and skills discovery, all central to this career platform.\n\n\n**Designing the Structure**\n\nI\'m now focused on the foundational structure, designing the component layout for the website. I will start with a top navigation bar using the SkillBridge AI logo, Home, Dashboard, and Analyze Resume. For now, my primary goal is a responsive landing page, with buttons to analyze resumes and explore features. I have decided to use React, TypeScript, and Lucide icons. I plan to use reusable components and clean code, for a modern SaaS design.\n\n\n**Refining the Navigation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the top navigation bar. The logo will be SkillBridge AI, a brand mark, with nav links for Home, Dashboard (with a preview modal), and Analyze Resume. There will be a right action button, \"Analyze My Resume\" or \"Get Started,\" and a mobile hamburger menu. I\'m building out a \"Hero\" component with a headline and subtitle, describing the AI-powered platform.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Hero**\n\nI\'m now iterating on the hero element. I\'m building an interactive preview card, showcasing a sample student\'s resume analysis. Users will be able to toggle between \"Skills Match\", \"Missing Gaps\", and \"Roadmap\". I\'m also styling the buttons, using an indigo/violet primary CTA for \"Analyze My Resume\" and a secondary CTA for \"Explore Features\" that scrolls to the `#features` section.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Cards**\n\nI\'m now focusing on developing a `FeatureCard` component for the personalized learning roadmaps. It\'s designed to provide step-by-step guidance. I\'m aiming for a clean, modern SaaS design with a subtle border, white background, soft hover effect, and clear typography. My next step will be to create an interactive \"Analyze My Resume\" modal, which is triggered from different parts of the website. I have the rough specifications for the modal, which allows users to upload a resume file or use a sample, and define their target job role.\n\n\n**Adding Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating an interactive dashboard preview within a modal, accessible from the navigation. This will show a readiness snapshot, progress bars for key skills, and recent resume scans. I\'m also adding a clean footer component with the logo, navigation, and legal information. I\'ve confirmed the necessary icons are available in Lucide. I\'m focusing on user-friendly animations for the modals and overall site.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4832118"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Sparkles, Menu, X, FileText, LayoutDashboard, ArrowRight } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface NavbarProps {\\n  onOpenAnalyze: () => void;\\n  onOpenDashboard: () => void;\\n  onNavigateHome: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Navbar: React.FC<NavbarProps> = ({\\n  onOpenAnalyze,\\n  onOpenDashboard,\\n  onNavigateHome,\\n}) => {\\n  const [mobileMenuOpen, setMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const handleNavClick = (action: () => void) => {\\n    action();\\n    setMobileMenuOpen(false);\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-40 w-full border-b border-slate-200/80 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        {/* Brand / Logo */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onNavigateHome}\\n          className=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2.5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500 rounded-lg p-1\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-sm transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105\\\">\\n            <Sparkles className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\\\">\\n              SkillBridge\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-indigo-600 uppercase\\\">\\n              AI\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Desktop Navigation Links */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onNavigateHome}\\n            className=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            Home\\n          </button>\\n          <a\\n            href=\\\"#features\\\"\\n            className=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            Features\\n          </a>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenDashboard}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <LayoutDashboard className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n            Dashboard\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenAnalyze}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <FileText className=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n            Analyze Resume\\n          </button>\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Desktop CTA */}\\n        <div className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenAnalyze}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition-all duration-150 hover:bg-indigo-700 hover:shadow active:scale-[0.98] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span>Analyze Resume</span>\\n            <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Mobile Menu Button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex md:hidden\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen(!mobileMenuOpen)}\\n            className=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-2 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-inset focus:ring-indigo-500\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Toggle navigation menu\\\"\\n          >\\n            {mobileMenuOpen ? (\\n              <X className=\\\"h-6 w-6\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n            ) : (\\n              <Menu className=\\\"h-6 w-6\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Menu Dropdown */}\\n      {mobileMenuOpen && (\\n        <div className=\\\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 pt-2 pb-6 md:hidden shadow-lg animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-150\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col space-y-3\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(onNavigateHome)}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center px-3 py-2 text-base font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-indigo-600 rounded-md text-left\\\"\\n            >\\n              Home\\n            </button>\\n            <a\\n              href=\\\"#features\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen(false)}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center px-3 py-2 text-base font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-indigo-600 rounded-md text-left\\\"\\n            >\\n              Features\\n            </a>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(onOpenDashboard)}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-base font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-indigo-600 rounded-md text-left\\\"\\n            >\\n              <LayoutDashboard className=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n              Dashboard\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => handleNavClick(onOpenAnalyze)}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-base font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-indigo-600 rounded-md text-left\\\"\\n            >\\n              <FileText className=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n              Analyze Resume\\n            </button>\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-2\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => handleNavClick(onOpenAnalyze)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow hover:bg-indigo-700\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>Analyze My Resume</span>\\n                <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create Navbar component for SkillBridge AI with responsive menu and working navigation handlers\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Navbar.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating Navbar component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create src/components/Navbar.tsx\"}"
