  planner_response {
    response: "The basic layout and foundation for **SkillBridge AI** is ready with a clean, modern SaaS aesthetic, indigo/violet accents, and responsive design.\n\n### What Was Built:\n- **Top Navigation Bar (`Navbar.tsx`)**:\n  - Features the **SkillBridge AI** logo with an indigo brand mark.\n  - Single-line navigation links for **Home**, **Features**, **Dashboard**, and **Analyze Resume**.\n  - Working **\"Analyze Resume\"** CTA and mobile drawer menu for smaller screens.\n\n- **Hero Section (`Hero.tsx`)**:\n  - Main headline: **\"Bridge Your Skills to Your Next Opportunity.\"**\n  - Platform subtitle explaining how SkillBridge AI analyzes student resumes against industry job descriptions.\n  - Two working buttons: **\"Analyze My Resume\"** (opens the interactive analyzer) and **\"Explore Features\"** (smoothly scrolls to the features section).\n  - An interactive live preview card demonstrating a student resume diagnostic with toggles for *Matched Skills*, *Skill Gaps*, and *Next Steps*.\n\n- **Feature Cards (`Features.tsx`)**:\n  - Three simple, structured cards with Lucide icons:\n    1. **AI Resume Analysis** (ATS readability, impact phrasing, formatting validation)\n    2. **Smart Job Matching** (Semantic job description comparison, match rate scoring)\n    3. **Personalized Learning Roadmaps** (Targeted milestones, curated student learning sprints)\n\n- **Interactive Modals (`AnalyzeModal.tsx` & `DashboardModal.tsx`)**:\n  - **Resume Analyzer**: Supports file upload dropzone, role selector, and 1-click sample student profiles with diagnostic preview results.\n  - **Student Dashboard**: Shows role alignment metrics, skill mastery progress, and tracked applications.\n\n- **Footer (`Footer.tsx`)**:\n  - Simple, quiet footer with logo, quick navigation links, and student career platform notices."
    thinking: "**Verifying Implementation Progress**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` tasks both completed successfully, with no errors detected. Furthermore, I\'ve confirmed that the core requirements of the user request are fully satisfied: we have a complete React and TypeScript implementation, and the design adheres to the specifications, featuring a clean white background with indigo/violet accents.\n\n\n**Confirming Feature Integration**\n\nI\'ve successfully integrated the UI elements, including the slate-surfaced canvas, indigo buttons, and violet accents. The site is now fully responsive, utilizing flex and grid breakpoints, a mobile hamburger menu, and stacking layouts. The top navigation bar, complete with the SkillBridge AI logo and functional links, is in place. The landing page, featuring the specified heading, subtitle, and interactive buttons (\"Analyze My Resume\" and \"Explore Features\"), is also ready. Feature cards for AI Resume Analysis, Smart Job Matching, and Personalized Learning Roadmaps, in a responsive grid with Lucide icons, have been incorporated. Finally, a clean footer completes the implementation.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "The basic layout and foundation for **SkillBridge AI** is ready with a clean, modern SaaS aesthetic, indigo/violet accents, and responsive design.\n\n### What Was Built:\n- **Top Navigation Bar (`Navbar.tsx`)**:\n  - Features the **SkillBridge AI** logo with an indigo brand mark.\n  - Single-line navigation links for **Home**, **Features**, **Dashboard**, and **Analyze Resume**.\n  - Working **\"Analyze Resume\"** CTA and mobile drawer menu for smaller screens.\n\n- **Hero Section (`Hero.tsx`)**:\n  - Main headline: **\"Bridge Your Skills to Your Next Opportunity.\"**\n  - Platform subtitle explaining how SkillBridge AI analyzes student resumes against industry job descriptions.\n  - Two working buttons: **\"Analyze My Resume\"** (opens the interactive analyzer) and **\"Explore Features\"** (smoothly scrolls to the features section).\n  - An interactive live preview card demonstrating a student resume diagnostic with toggles for *Matched Skills*, *Skill Gaps*, and *Next Steps*.\n\n- **Feature Cards (`Features.tsx`)**:\n  - Three simple, structured cards with Lucide icons:\n    1. **AI Resume Analysis** (ATS readability, impact phrasing, formatting validation)\n    2. **Smart Job Matching** (Semantic job description comparison, match rate scoring)\n    3. **Personalized Learning Roadmaps** (Targeted milestones, curated student learning sprints)\n\n- **Interactive Modals (`AnalyzeModal.tsx` & `DashboardModal.tsx`)**:\n  - **Resume Analyzer**: Supports file upload dropzone, role selector, and 1-click sample student profiles with diagnostic preview results.\n  - **Student Dashboard**: Shows role alignment metrics, skill mastery progress, and tracked applications.\n\n- **Footer (`Footer.tsx`)**:\n  - Simple, quiet footer with logo, quick navigation links, and student career platform notices."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 662834600
    }
