  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Dashboard Page**\n\nI\'m focusing on incorporating a dedicated dashboard page into SkillBridge AI. I\'m prioritizing minimal disruption to the existing design. The goal is to make it seamless. I\'m keeping the white background and indigo accents, as per the established design language. It needs to feel part of the current user interface, not an add-on.\n\n\n**Refining the Dashboard Page**\n\nI\'m now integrating violet accents to the typography, and ensuring responsive design for the dashboard. I\'m focusing on maximum UI component reuse from the existing navigation bar and footer. I\'ve added a dashboard page via a new navigation link for seamless view switching. I\'ve incorporated the welcome heading \"Welcome to Your Career Dashboard\" and four summary cards: Total Resume Analyses, Average Job Match, Skills to Improve, and Learning Tasks Completed. I\'m also adding a \"Recent Analyses\" section.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Functionality for Roadmap**\n\nI\'m focused on developing the interactive roadmap and interview prep. I\'m ensuring all actions work with realistic sample data. I\'m making navigation links and buttons functional across all pages. I\'m maintaining responsiveness for desktop and mobile, and maintaining code cleanliness and reusability, with no new authentication, databases, or AI functionality. I\'m focusing on preserving current working functionality and error-free operation.\n\n\n**Implementing Page Navigation**\n\nI\'m now implementing the navigation updates to `src/App.tsx`. I\'ve introduced a `currentPage` state that dictates which components render, ensuring clean and intuitive navigation between the home, dashboard, and analyze views. I\'m focusing on highlighting the active page in the navbar for a clear user experience. This includes rendering the `<Hero />` and `<Features />` components for the home page, `<DashboardPage />` for the dashboard, and `<AnalyzePage />` for the analyze view. Also, I will ensure smooth transitioning for the analyzer modal.\n\n\n**Constructing the Dashboard\'s UI**\n\nI\'m now creating the UI for the dashboard, specifically `src/components/DashboardPage.tsx`. I\'ve added a welcome heading and subtitle explaining the simulated data. There\'s also a \"Preview Mode\" indicator. I\'m incorporating a prominent \"Analyze My Resume\" CTA. The four summary cards are in place, showing sample data, and I\'ve also constructed the \"Recent Analyses\" section with example job titles. I\'m focusing on a clean and informative layout.\n\n\n**Expanding Recent Analyses**\n\nI\'m expanding the \"Recent Analyses\" section of the dashboard. I\'ve added a list of job titles with match percentages and analysis dates. Each item will have a \"View Details\" action button, expanding to show matched skills, missing skills, and recommended focus areas. I\'m also adding a new Quick Actions Section with clickable cards for Analyze Resume, View Learning Roadmap, and Prepare for Interview, using Lucide icons.\n\n\n**Adding the Resume Analysis**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a prominent \"Analyze My Resume\" CTA, ensuring users can quickly start a new scan. I\'m inspecting `src/components/Navbar.tsx` for visual highlighting of the active page. I\'m passing `currentPage` as a prop to manage the active state visually. I\'m also preparing for the implementation by defining and centralizing sample data in `src/data/sampleData.ts`, and I am structuring the dashboard and analysis details into dedicated components. I will include `AnalysisDetailModal.tsx`, as well as `QuickActionModal.tsx` for \"View Learning Roadmap.\"\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5007862"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * Realistic sample data for SkillBridge AI Student Career Dashboard.\\n * Kept strictly isolated as preview/demonstration data.\\n */\\n\\nexport interface RecentAnalysis {\\n  id: string;\\n  roleTitle: string;\\n  companyTarget: string;\\n  matchScore: number;\\n  dateAnalyzed: string;\\n  resumeFileName: string;\\n  matchedSkills: string[];\\n  missingSkills: string[];\\n  topRecommendation: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SummaryMetric {\\n  title: string;\\n  value: string;\\n  changeText: string;\\n  isPositive: boolean;\\n  sublabel: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const SAMPLE_DASHBOARD_METRICS: SummaryMetric[] = [\\n  {\\n    title: \'Total Resume Analyses\',\\n    value: \'8\',\\n    changeText: \'+3 this month\',\\n    isPositive: true,\\n    sublabel: \'Across 4 target role types\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \'Average Job Match\',\\n    value: \'84%\',\\n    changeText: \'+9% improvement\',\\n    isPositive: true,\\n    sublabel: \'Compared to baseline scan\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \'Skills to Improve\',\\n    value: \'5\',\\n    changeText: \'2 high-priority\',\\n    isPositive: false,\\n    sublabel: \'Identified from job postings\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \'Learning Tasks Completed\',\\n    value: \'12 / 16\',\\n    changeText: \'75% completed\',\\n    isPositive: true,\\n    sublabel: \'Roadmap milestone progress\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const SAMPLE_RECENT_ANALYSES: RecentAnalysis[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'analysis-1\',\\n    roleTitle: \'Junior Full-Stack Engineer\',\\n    companyTarget: \'FinTech Labs (San Francisco, CA)\',\\n    matchScore: 88,\\n    dateAnalyzed: \'Oct 14, 2026\',\\n    resumeFileName: \'Alex_Chen_SWE_Resume_v3.pdf\',\\n    matchedSkills: [\'TypeScript\', \'React 18\', \'Node.js\', \'REST APIs\', \'PostgreSQL\', \'Git Workflow\'],\\n    missingSkills: [\'Docker Containerization\', \'Automated Unit Testing (Vitest/Jest)\', \'AWS Lambda\'],\\n    topRecommendation: \'Add unit tests for your REST API endpoints to demonstrate production-level software rigor.\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'analysis-2\',\\n    roleTitle: \'Associate Frontend Developer\',\\n    companyTarget: \'CloudScale Inc. (Remote)\',\\n    matchScore: 92,\\n    dateAnalyzed: \'Oct 08, 2026\',\\n    resumeFileName: \'Alex_Chen_Frontend_v2.pdf\',\\n    matchedSkills: [\'React\', \'TypeScript\', \'Tailwind CSS\', \'Responsive Layouts\', \'State Management\', \'Web Accessibility (a11y)\'],\\n    missingSkills: [\'Next.js SSR\', \'Performance Profiling (Lighthouse)\'],\\n    topRecommendation: \'Showcase Web Core Vitals metrics in your featured portfolio project description.\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'analysis-3\',\\n    roleTitle: \'Data & Analytics Intern\',\\n    companyTarget: \'Apex Insights (Austin, TX)\',\\n    matchScore: 79,\\n    dateAnalyzed: \'Sep 28, 2026\',\\n    resumeFileName: \'Alex_Chen_General_Resume.pdf\',\\n    matchedSkills: [\'Python\', \'SQL Querying\', \'Pandas\', \'Data Visualization\', \'Git\'],\\n    missingSkills: [\'Tableau / PowerBI\', \'ETL Pipeline Modeling\', \'Statistics for A/B Testing\'],\\n    topRecommendation: \'Create a GitHub notebook walking through exploratory data analysis on a public dataset.\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'analysis-4\',\\n    roleTitle: \'Junior Backend Developer\',\\n    companyTarget: \'Streamline Systems (New York, NY)\',\\n    matchScore: 81,\\n    dateAnalyzed: \'Sep 19, 2026\',\\n    resumeFileName: \'Alex_Chen_Backend_v1.pdf\',\\n    matchedSkills: [\'Node.js\', \'Express\', \'SQL\', \'Database Indexing\', \'API Auth (JWT)\'],\\n    missingSkills: [\'Redis Caching\', \'Microservices Architecture\', \'Kubernetes Basics\'],\\n    topRecommendation: \'Implement a Redis caching layer for heavy read queries in your portfolio backend service.\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const SAMPLE_ROADMAP_MILESTONES = [\\n  {\\n    title: \'Containerize Full-Stack App with Docker\',\\n    category: \'DevOps & Tooling\',\\n    status: \'In Progress\',\\n    timeEstimate: \'3 hours\',\\n    description: \'Write a clean multi-stage Dockerfile and docker-compose.yml for your React + Node app.\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \'Write Comprehensive Unit Tests with Vitest\',\\n    category: \'Software Quality\',\\n    status: \'Next Up\',\\n    timeEstimate: \'4 hours\',\\n    description: \'Achieve 80%+ test coverage on core utility functions and API request handlers.\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    title: \'Optimize Core Web Vitals to 95+ on Lighthouse\',\\n    category: \'Frontend Performance\',\\n    status: \'Completed\',\\n    timeEstimate: \'2 hours\',\\n    description: \'Reduce bundle size, lazy-load heavy modules, and optimize image rendering.\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const SAMPLE_INTERVIEW_QUESTIONS = [\\n  {\\n    question: \'How do you handle asynchronous error states in React and ensure clean user fallback UI?\',\\n    category: \'Technical Architecture\',\\n    relevance: \'Matched from your React & TypeScript experience\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    question: \'Describe how you would design a RESTful API endpoint that needs pagination and filtering.\',\\n    category: \'API & Backend\',\\n    relevance: \'Matched from your Node.js & Express projects\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    question: \'Walk through a challenging bug you encountered in a team project and how you diagnosed it.\',\\n    category: \'Behavioral & Collaboration\',\\n    relevance: \'Standard entry-level engineering behavioral screen\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create sample data file containing realistic mock metrics and recent analyses for the student dashboard\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/data/sampleData.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating sampleData.ts\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create src/data/sampleData.ts\"}"
