  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Dashboard Page**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the `DashboardPage.tsx` component. I\'m carefully verifying all the design requirements. Right now, I\'m focusing on preserving the existing visual style - the white background, indigo/violet accents, typography, and responsive design. The goal is to reuse the navigation bar and footer components.\n\n\n**Designing Dashboard Components**\n\nI\'m now designing `DashboardPage.tsx`, aiming to display essential career data. I\'ve decided to include \"Total Resume Analyses,\" \"Average Job Match,\" \"Skills to Improve,\" and \"Learning Tasks Completed\" summary cards. I\'ll add \"Recent Analyses\" with job titles, match scores, dates, and \"View Details\". There will be \"Analyze My Resume\", \"View Learning Roadmap\", and \"Prepare for Interview\" quick actions. I\'ll keep it simple, without authentication or AI.\n\n\n**Defining Welcome Section**\n\nI\'m now defining the welcome section of the dashboard. I\'ve settled on \"Welcome to Your Career Dashboard\" for the heading and a subtitle explaining the dashboard\'s purpose. I\'ll add a sample data banner with \"Demo Profile: Alex Chen (Senior CS Student)\" to demonstrate the features. I will make the \"Analyze My Resume\" button prominent, both in the hero and a featured banner.\n\n\n**Defining Quick Actions**\n\nI\'m now defining the quick action cards for the dashboard. I\'m focusing on \"Analyze Resume\", \"View Learning Roadmap\", and \"Prepare for Interview\". Each card has an icon, a descriptive sentence, and a button. \"Analyze Resume\" calls `onOpenAnalyze()`. \"View Roadmap\" opens `QuickActionModal` with the roadmap. \"Prepare for Interview\" also opens `QuickActionModal` with interview prep.\n\nI\'ve moved on to the design of the \"Recent Analyses\" section. This will be a filterable table with cards, showing Job Role, Target Company, Match Score, Date Analyzed, and a \"View Details\" button. Clicking \"View Details\" will allow users to review a full analysis breakdown. Finally, I\'m adding a secondary CTA banner before the footer with the text, \"Ready to optimize for a new job opportunity?\" and a button.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5896570"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  FileText,\\n  TrendingUp,\\n  AlertCircle,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  Compass,\\n  MessageSquare,\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  Building2,\\n  Calendar,\\n  ChevronRight,\\n  Info,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport {\\n  SAMPLE_DASHBOARD_METRICS,\\n  SAMPLE_RECENT_ANALYSES,\\n  RecentAnalysis,\\n} from \'../data/sampleData\';\\nimport { AnalysisDetailModal } from \'./AnalysisDetailModal\';\\nimport { QuickActionModal } from \'./QuickActionModal\';\\n\\ninterface DashboardPageProps {\\n  onOpenAnalyze: (role?: string) => void;\\n  onNavigateHome: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const DashboardPage: React.FC<DashboardPageProps> = ({\\n  onOpenAnalyze,\\n  onNavigateHome,\\n}) => {\\n  const [selectedAnalysis, setSelectedAnalysis] = useState<RecentAnalysis | null>(null);\\n  const [quickActionType, setQuickActionType] = useState<\'roadmap\' | \'interview\' | null>(null);\\n\\n  const getMetricIcon = (title: string) => {\\n    switch (title) {\\n      case \'Total Resume Analyses\':\\n        return <FileText className=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\\\" />;\\n      case \'Average Job Match\':\\n        return <TrendingUp className=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-emerald-600\\\" />;\\n      case \'Skills to Improve\':\\n        return <AlertCircle className=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-amber-600\\\" />;\\n      case \'Learning Tasks Completed\':\\n        return <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\\\" />;\\n      default:\\n        return <Sparkles className=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\\\" />;\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-white min-h-screen pb-20\\\">\\n      {/* Sample Data Disclaimer Banner */}\\n      <div className=\\\"border-b border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/60 px-4 py-2.5\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between text-xs text-indigo-800\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <Info className=\\\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-indigo-600\\\" />\\n            <span>\\n              <strong>Sample Preview Mode:</strong> Showing demo data for candidate <em>Alex Chen</em> (CS Senior) to preview dashboard functionality.\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onOpenAnalyze()}\\n            className=\\\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-indigo-700 hover:text-indigo-900 underline underline-offset-2 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span>Scan your own resume</span>\\n            <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-3 w-3\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 sm:pt-12\\\">\\n        {/* Welcome Header & Prominent CTA */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-600 mb-2\\\">\\n              <Sparkles className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>Career Readiness Center</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h1 className=\\\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900\\\">\\n              Welcome to Your Career Dashboard\\n            </h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Track your resume match ratings, identified skill gaps, and learning progression across target technical roles.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Prominent Analyze My Resume Action Button */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => onOpenAnalyze()}\\n              className=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-indigo-700 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-indigo-500/20 active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <FileText className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n              <span>Analyze My Resume</span>\\n              <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* 4 Summary Cards */}\\n        <section className=\\\"mt-8\\\">\\n          <h2 className=\\\"sr-only\\\">Performance Summary</h2>\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5\\\">\\n            {SAMPLE_DASHBOARD_METRICS.map((metric, idx) => (\\n              <div\\n                key={idx}\\n                className=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-2xs transition-all hover:border-indigo-200 hover:shadow-md\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    {metric.title}\\n                  </span>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100\\\">\\n                    {getMetricIcon(metric.title)}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-4\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 tabular-nums\\\">\\n                    {metric.value}\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                    <span\\n                      className={`text-xs font-semibold ${\\n                        metric.isPositive ? \'text-emerald-700\' : \'text-amber-700\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {metric.changeText}\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-slate-300\\\">\302\267</span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 truncate\\\">\\n                      {metric.sublabel}\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        {/* Quick Actions Section */}\\n        <section className=\\\"mt-12\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-5\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                Quick Actions\\n              </h2>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                Essential workflows to accelerate your technical job search\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5\\\">\\n            {/* Action 1: Analyze Resume */}\\n            <div className=\\\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-2xs transition-all hover:border-indigo-300 hover:shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 transition-colors group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white\\\">\\n                  <FileText className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n                <h3 className=\\\"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                  Analyze Resume\\n                </h3>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\\\">\\n                  Upload a fresh PDF version or compare your current profile against a new technical job description.\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => onOpenAnalyze()}\\n                  className=\\\"inline-flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:text-indigo-600 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <span>Start New Analysis</span>\\n                  <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Action 2: View Learning Roadmap */}\\n            <div className=\\\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-2xs transition-all hover:border-indigo-300 hover:shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 transition-colors group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white\\\">\\n                  <Compass className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n                <h3 className=\\\"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                  View Learning Roadmap\\n                </h3>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\\\">\\n                  Follow step-by-step milestones to master containerization, unit testing, and full-stack system architecture.\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setQuickActionType(\'roadmap\')}\\n                  className=\\\"inline-flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:text-indigo-600 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <span>Open Roadmap</span>\\n                  <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Action 3: Prepare for Interview */}\\n            <div className=\\\"group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-2xs transition-all hover:border-indigo-300 hover:shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 transition-colors group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white\\\">\\n                  <MessageSquare className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n                <h3 className=\\\"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                  Prepare for Interview\\n                </h3>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\\\">\\n                  Generate realistic screening questions grounded directly in your listed projects and candidate profile.\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setQuickActionType(\'interview\')}\\n                  className=\\\"inline-flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:text-indigo-600 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <span>Practice Questions</span>\\n                  <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        {/* Recent Analyses Section */}\\n        <section className=\\\"mt-12\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3 mb-5\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                Recent Analyses\\n              </h2>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                Past evaluations matching candidate resumes against target job descriptions\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">\\n              4 Scans Recorded\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-2xs\\\">\\n            {/* Desktop Table */}\\n            <div className=\\\"hidden md:block overflow-x-auto\\\">\\n              <table className=\\\"w-full text-left border-collapse\\\">\\n                <thead>\\n                  <tr className=\\\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600\\\">\\n                    <th scope=\\\"col\\\" className=\\\"px-6 py-3.5\\\">Target Position & Company</th>\\n                    <th scope=\\\"col\\\" className=\\\"px-6 py-3.5\\\">Resume File</th>\\n                    <th scope=\\\"col\\\" className=\\\"px-6 py-3.5\\\">Match Score</th>\\n                    <th scope=\\\"col\\\" className=\\\"px-6 py-3.5\\\">Date</th>\\n                    <th scope=\\\"col\\\" className=\\\"px-6 py-3.5 text-right\\\">Action</th>\\n                  </tr>\\n                </thead>\\n                <tbody className=\\\"divide-y divide-slate-100 text-xs\\\">\\n                  {SAMPLE_RECENT_ANALYSES.map((item) => (\\n                    <tr\\n                      key={item.id}\\n                      className=\\\"hover:bg-slate-50/70 transition-colors\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <td className=\\\"px-6 py-4\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\\\">\\n                          {item.roleTitle}\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-500 mt-0.5 text-xs\\\">\\n                          <Building2 className=\\\"h-3 w-3\\\" />\\n                          <span>{item.companyTarget}</span>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </td>\\n\\n                      <td className=\\\"px-6 py-4 text-slate-600 font-mono text-[11px]\\\">\\n                        {item.resumeFileName}\\n                      </td>\\n\\n                      <td className=\\\"px-6 py-4\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                          <span\\n                            className={`inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold tabular-nums ${\\n                              item.matchScore >= 85\\n                                ? \'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200/60\'\\n                                : \'bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-200/60\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            {item.matchScore}%\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\\\">\\n                            {item.matchScore >= 85 ? \'Strong match\' : \'Good match\'}\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </td>\\n\\n                      <td className=\\\"px-6 py-4 text-slate-500 text-xs whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                          <Calendar className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                          <span>{item.dateAnalyzed}</span>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </td>\\n\\n                      <td className=\\\"px-6 py-4 text-right\\\">\\n                        <button\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => setSelectedAnalysis(item)}\\n                          className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:border-indigo-300 transition-all cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <span>View Details</span>\\n                          <ChevronRight className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                        </button>\\n                      </td>\\n                    </tr>\\n                  ))}\\n                </tbody>\\n              </table>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Mobile Card List */}\\n            <div className=\\\"md:hidden divide-y divide-slate-100\\\">\\n              {SAMPLE_RECENT_ANALYSES.map((item) => (\\n                <div key={item.id} className=\\\"p-4 space-y-3\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <h3 className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\\\">\\n                        {item.roleTitle}\\n                      </h3>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                        {item.companyTarget}\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <span\\n                      className={`inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold tabular-nums ${\\n                        item.matchScore >= 85\\n                          ? \'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\'\\n                          : \'bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {item.matchScore}%\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 pt-1\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] truncate max-w-[180px]\\\">\\n                      {item.resumeFileName}\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span>{item.dateAnalyzed}</span>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setSelectedAnalysis(item)}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <span>View Details</span>\\n                    <ChevronRight className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              ))}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        {/* Bottom Prominent Call to Action */}\\n        <section className=\\\"mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50/60 via-white to-violet-50/40 p-8 text-center sm:text-left flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-1.5 max-w-xl\\\">\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n              Applying for a new role?\\n            </h2>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600\\\">\\n              Upload your resume and test it against specific company job descriptions to maximize interview invitation rates.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onOpenAnalyze()}\\n            className=\\\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-indigo-700 hover:shadow-md active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          >\\n            <FileText className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n            <span>Analyze My Resume</span>\\n            <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </section>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Analysis Details Modal */}\\n      <AnalysisDetailModal\\n        analysis={selectedAnalysis}\\n        onClose={() => setSelectedAnalysis(null)}\\n        onRetest={(role) => onOpenAnalyze(role)}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Quick Action Roadmap / Interview Prep Modal */}\\n      <QuickActionModal\\n        type={quickActionType}\\n        onClose={() => setQuickActionType(null)}\\n        onOpenAnalyze={() => onOpenAnalyze()}\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create full DashboardPage component implementing all requirements, summary cards, recent analyses with View Details, and Quick Actions\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/DashboardPage.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating DashboardPage component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create src/components/DashboardPage.tsx\"}"
