  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Analysis Page**\n\nI\'m starting the Resume Analysis page design. It\'s following SkillBridge AI\'s existing color scheme: white, indigo, and violet. The heading will be \"Analyze Your Career Fit\" and the subtitle is set to \"Discover how your skills align with your dream role.\" I\'m aiming for a clean and user-friendly interface.\n\n\n**Refining the Upload Process**\n\nI\'m focused on the resume and job description sections of the analysis page. I\'m building out a drag-and-drop area for PDF uploads, displaying the filename and size. I\'ve also incorporated a removal button, and validation to ensure the user uploads a .pdf, with a helpful error message for invalid files. I\'m also adding a text area for resume text, as an alternative to uploading the PDF. Finally, I\'ve created a text area for the job description and including a placeholder with a sample job description to provide a user-friendly experience.\n\n\n**Implementing the Analyze Button**\n\nI\'ve just added the \"Analyze My Match\" button; it\'s disabled if data is missing, and shows a loading indicator on submission. I\'m prioritizing clear, temporary messaging post-submission, explaining that the analysis engine is currently inactive. Also, I\'ve added a one-click demo button.\n\nI\'ve also integrated validation errors and a privacy notice about personal data in resumes, for a more user-friendly experience. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and code maintainability, reusing components where possible.\n\n\n**Integrating Navigation Elements**\n\nI\'ve updated the `Navbar` and `App.tsx` to ensure \"Analyze Resume\" directs users to the dedicated analysis page, maintaining the active page state. All links across the existing landing page, dashboard, and footer now correctly navigate to the new Resume Analysis page. I made sure that `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` both succeeded. I\'m prioritizing user flow and a consistent site structure.\n\n\n**Enhancing the Upload Interface**\n\nI\'m focused on the resume upload feature now. I\'ve built in drag-over state feedback for the PDF upload, along with validation to ensure it\'s a PDF. When a file is uploaded, I\'m displaying a file info card with the name, size, and a remove button. I\'ve also incorporated a \"Paste Resume Text\" tab with character count. The job description section is also nearing completion. I\'ve included a sample job description as a placeholder and a button to automatically fill it.\n\n\n**Confirming Form Validation**\n\nI\'ve crafted a status card confirming successful form validation. It will read \"Resume & Job Description Ready for Analysis\" with an explanatory message about the upcoming AI integration. There are actions to return to edit inputs or go to the dashboard. I\'ve also incorporated a privacy notice card with a lock icon, ensuring users of the local processing during this phase. I\'m updating the `Navbar` to include an \"analyze\" option, and the `App.tsx` page to render the correct view.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3975180"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  FileText,\\n  UploadCloud,\\n  X,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  AlertCircle,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  ClipboardList,\\n  RotateCcw,\\n  Building2,\\n  FileCheck,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface ResumeAnalysisPageProps {\\n  onNavigateDashboard: () => void;\\n  onNavigateHome: () => void;\\n  initialRole?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const ResumeAnalysisPage: React.FC<ResumeAnalysisPageProps> = ({\\n  onNavigateDashboard,\\n  onNavigateHome,\\n  initialRole,\\n}) => {\\n  // Input mode: \'upload\' (PDF) or \'paste\' (text)\\n  const [resumeMode, setResumeMode] = useState<\'upload\' | \'paste\'>(\'upload\');\\n\\n  // File state\\n  const [uploadedFile, setUploadedFile] = useState<File | null>(null);\\n  const [fileError, setFileError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n  const [isDragging, setIsDragging] = useState(false);\\n  const fileInputRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement>(null);\\n\\n  // Text resume state\\n  const [pastedResume, setPastedResume] = useState(\'\');\\n\\n  // Job description state\\n  const [jobDescription, setJobDescription] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [jobError, setJobError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n\\n  // Submission state\\n  const [isSubmitting, setIsSubmitting] = useState(false);\\n  const [submittedSuccess, setSubmittedSuccess] = useState(false);\\n\\n  // Format file size in KB/MB\\n  const formatFileSize = (bytes: number): string => {\\n    if (bytes < 1024) return `${bytes} B`;\\n    if (bytes < 1024 * 1024) return `${(bytes / 1024).toFixed(1)} KB`;\\n    return `${(bytes / (1024 * 1024)).toFixed(2)} MB`;\\n  };\\n\\n  // Validate and handle file selection\\n  const handleFileProcess = (file: File) => {\\n    setFileError(null);\\n    setSubmittedSuccess(false);\\n\\n    // Validate PDF type\\n    const isPdf =\\n      file.type === \'application/pdf\' ||\\n      file.name.toLowerCase().endsWith(\'.pdf\');\\n\\n    if (!isPdf) {\\n      setFileError(\'Invalid file format. Please upload a PDF file only (.pdf).\');\\n      setUploadedFile(null);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Check size limit (10MB)\\n    if (file.size > 10 * 1024 * 1024) {\\n      setFileError(\'File exceeds 10MB size limit. Please upload a smaller PDF.\');\\n      setUploadedFile(null);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setUploadedFile(file);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDragOver = (e: React.DragEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    setIsDragging(true);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDragLeave = (e: React.DragEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    setIsDragging(false);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDrop = (e: React.DragEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    setIsDragging(false);\\n    if (e.dataTransfer.files && e.dataTransfer.files.length > 0) {\\n      handleFileProcess(e.dataTransfer.files[0]);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleFileInputChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\\n    if (e.target.files && e.target.files.length > 0) {\\n      handleFileProcess(e.target.files[0]);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleRemoveFile = () => {\\n    setUploadedFile(null);\\n    setFileError(null);\\n    if (fileInputRef.current) {\\n      fileInputRef.current.value = \'\';\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Populate sample job description for quick testing\\n  const handleUseSampleJob = () => {\\n    setJobError(null);\\n    setJobDescription(\\n`Role: Junior Full-Stack Developer\\nCompany: CloudScale Solutions\\nLocation: Remote (US / Canada)\\n\\nAbout the Role:\\nWe are looking for an ambitious Junior Full-Stack Developer to join our core product team. You will build user-facing features using modern web technologies and collaborate with senior engineers on scalable services.\\n\\nResponsibilities:\\n- Build and maintain responsive web interfaces using React, TypeScript, and modern CSS frameworks.\\n- Implement RESTful APIs with Node.js and Express to support frontend features.\\n- Write clean, maintainable, and well-tested code following agile best practices.\\n- Collaborate with product designers and engineers in daily standups and sprint planning.\\n\\nRequirements:\\n- Bachelor\'s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or equivalent practical experience / bootcamp.\\n- Demonstrated hands-on experience with TypeScript, React, and component architecture.\\n- Understanding of backend development with Node.js and SQL/relational databases.\\n- Familiarity with version control using Git and collaborative pull request workflows.\\n- Basic familiarity with Docker, CI/CD, or automated unit testing is a plus.`\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  // Populate sample resume text\\n  const handleUseSampleResume = () => {\\n    setResumeMode(\'paste\');\\n    setPastedResume(\\n`ALEX CHEN\\nComputer Science B.S., Expected Graduation May 2026\\nEmail: alex.chen@university.edu | GitHub: github.com/alexchen-dev\\n\\nTECHNICAL SKILLS:\\n- Languages: TypeScript, JavaScript (ES6+), Python, HTML5, CSS3, SQL\\n- Frameworks & Libraries: React, Node.js, Express, Tailwind CSS, Vite\\n- Tools & Practices: Git, GitHub, REST APIs, Agile Methodology, Linux\\n\\nPROJECTS:\\n1. Campus Marketplace Web App (React, TypeScript, Node.js, PostgreSQL)\\n- Developed a full-stack campus exchange portal serving 1,200+ active student users.\\n- Designed RESTful API endpoints for user authentication, product listings, and instant messaging.\\n- Implemented responsive UI with Tailwind CSS achieving 95+ score on Google Lighthouse.\\n\\n2. Algorithmic Pathfinding Visualizer (React, TypeScript)\\n- Built interactive graph visualization demonstrating Dijkstra\'s, A*, and BFS pathfinding algorithms.\\n- Optimized canvas rendering performance to maintain smooth 60fps animations.\\n\\nEXPERIENCE:\\nComputer Science Peer Tutor (Sep 2024 - Present)\\n- Facilitated weekly lab sessions for 45+ students covering data structures and object-oriented programming.`\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  // Validation logic\\n  const hasResumeInput =\\n    resumeMode === \'upload\' ? !!uploadedFile : pastedResume.trim().length > 30;\\n  const hasJobInput = jobDescription.trim().length > 20;\\n  const isFormValid = hasResumeInput && hasJobInput;\\n\\n  // Form submission\\n  const handleSubmit = (e: React.FormEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n\\n    if (!hasResumeInput) {\\n      if (resumeMode === \'upload\') {\\n        setFileError(\'Please upload your resume PDF to proceed.\');\\n      } else {\\n        setFileError(\'Please paste your resume text to proceed.\');\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!hasJobInput) {\\n      setJobError(\'Please provide a job description to compare against.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setIsSubmitting(true);\\n    setSubmittedSuccess(false);\\n\\n    // Simulate validation and staging process\\n    setTimeout(() => {\\n      setIsSubmitting(false);\\n      setSubmittedSuccess(true);\\n      window.scrollTo({ top: 300, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }, 800);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleResetForm = () => {\\n    setUploadedFile(null);\\n    setPastedResume(\'\');\\n    setJobDescription(\'\');\\n    setFileError(null);\\n    setJobError(null);\\n    setSubmittedSuccess(false);\\n    if (fileInputRef.current) fileInputRef.current.value = \'\';\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-white min-h-screen pb-24\\\">\\n      {/* Page Header */}\\n      <section className=\\\"border-b border-slate-200/80 bg-slate-50/50 py-12 sm:py-16\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/70 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700 mb-4\\\">\\n            <Sparkles className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-indigo-600\\\" />\\n            <span>AI Career Match Analysis</span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <h1 className=\\\"text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\\\">\\n            Analyze Your Career Fit\\n          </h1>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-3 text-base text-slate-600 sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\\\">\\n            Discover how your skills align with your dream role.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Main Form Container */}\\n      <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-10\\\">\\n        {/* Temporary Submission Status Alert */}\\n        {submittedSuccess && (\\n          <div className=\\\"mb-10 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50/90 via-white to-violet-50/70 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-4 duration-300\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-start gap-4\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-xs\\\">\\n                <FileCheck className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-2 flex-1\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-1\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                    Resume & Job Description Successfully Staged\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-100/70 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full self-start sm:self-auto\\\">\\n                    Ready for Ingestion\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                  Your inputs have been verified and structured. The <strong>AI analysis engine</strong> will be connected in the next development step to perform deep semantic skill extraction, ATS keyword matching, and personalized learning roadmap generation.\\n                </p>\\n\\n                {/* Staged Metadata Snapshot */}\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-4 text-xs space-y-2\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-slate-600\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-800\\\">Resume Source:</span>\\n                    <span>\\n                      {uploadedFile\\n                        ? `${uploadedFile.name} (${formatFileSize(uploadedFile.size)})`\\n                        : `Pasted Text (${pastedResume.trim().length} characters)`}\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-slate-600\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-800\\\">Target Role:</span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"truncate max-w-[280px]\\\">\\n                      {jobDescription.split(\'\\\\n\')[0].replace(/role:|title:/i, \'\').trim() || \'Custom Job Description\'}\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-3\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => setSubmittedSuccess(false)}\\n                    className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <span>Edit Inputs</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={onNavigateDashboard}\\n                    className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <span>View Career Dashboard</span>\\n                    <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\\\"space-y-10\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start\\\">\\n            {/* Left Column: Resume Input Section */}\\n            <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-2xs space-y-5\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                  <h2 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                    1. Your Resume\\n                  </h2>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    Upload your PDF or paste resume text\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Input Mode Selector */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex rounded-lg bg-slate-100 p-1 text-xs font-medium\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setResumeMode(\'upload\');\\n                      setFileError(null);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={`rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                      resumeMode === \'upload\'\\n                        ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-xs font-semibold\'\\n                        : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    Upload PDF\\n                  </button>\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setResumeMode(\'paste\');\\n                      setFileError(null);\\n                    }}\\n                    className={`rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                      resumeMode === \'paste\'\\n                        ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-xs font-semibold\'\\n                        : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    Paste Text\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Mode A: Drag & Drop PDF */}\\n              {resumeMode === \'upload\' ? (\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n                  {!uploadedFile ? (\\n                    <div\\n                      onDragOver={handleDragOver}\\n                      onDragLeave={handleDragLeave}\\n                      onDrop={handleDrop}\\n                      className={`relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed p-8 sm:p-10 text-center transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                        isDragging\\n                          ? \'border-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50/60 scale-[1.01]\'\\n                          : fileError\\n                          ? \'border-red-300 bg-red-50/20\'\\n                          : \'border-slate-300 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-indigo-50/20\'\\n                      }`}\\n                      onClick={() => fileInputRef.current?.click()}\\n                    >\\n                      <input\\n                        ref={fileInputRef}\\n                        type=\\\"file\\\"\\n                        accept=\\\".pdf,application/pdf\\\"\\n                        onChange={handleFileInputChange}\\n                        className=\\\"hidden\\\"\\n                        id=\\\"resume-file-input\\\"\\n                      />\\n\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-xs border border-slate-200/80 text-indigo-600 mb-3\\\">\\n                        <UploadCloud className=\\\"h-7 w-7\\\" />\\n                      </div>\\n\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                        Drop your resume PDF here, or{\' \'}\\n                        <span className=\\\"text-indigo-600 underline underline-offset-2\\\">browse</span>\\n                      </p>\\n                      <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                        Supports PDF files only (up to 10MB)\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                  ) : (\\n                    /* Uploaded File Presentation Card */\\n                    <div className=\\\"rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50/40 p-4 transition-all\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-xs\\\">\\n                            <FileText className=\\\"h-5 w-5\\\" />\\n                          </div>\\n                          <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                            <p className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 truncate\\\">\\n                              {uploadedFile.name}\\n                            </p>\\n                            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 tabular-nums\\\">\\n                              {formatFileSize(uploadedFile.size)} \302\267 PDF Document\\n                            </p>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n                          <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded px-2 py-0.5\\\">\\n                            <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"h-3 w-3\\\" />\\n                            Valid PDF\\n                          </span>\\n                          <button\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={handleRemoveFile}\\n                            className=\\\"rounded-lg p-1.5 text-slate-400 hover:bg-white hover:text-red-600 hover:shadow-xs transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                            title=\\\"Remove file\\\"\\n                            aria-label=\\\"Remove uploaded file\\\"\\n                          >\\n                            <X className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                          </button>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  )}\\n\\n                  {/* File Error Message */}\\n                  {fileError && (\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50/70 p-3 text-xs text-red-700 animate-in fade-in duration-150\\\">\\n                      <AlertCircle className=\\\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-red-600\\\" />\\n                      <span>{fileError}</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                  )}\\n\\n                  {/* Quick Helper */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pt-1 text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    <span>Don\'t have a PDF ready?</span>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={handleUseSampleResume}\\n                      className=\\\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700 underline underline-offset-2 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Use Sample Student Resume\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              ) : (\\n                /* Mode B: Paste Resume Text */\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                    <textarea\\n                      rows={9}\\n                      value={pastedResume}\\n                      onChange={(e) => {\\n                        setPastedResume(e.target.value);\\n                        setFileError(null);\\n                        setSubmittedSuccess(false);\\n                      }}\\n                      placeholder={`Paste your resume text here...\\\\n\\\\nExample:\\\\nAlex Chen\\\\nComputer Science Graduate\\\\nSkills: TypeScript, React, Python, REST APIs, Git\\\\nProjects: Campus Marketplace Web App...`}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 p-3.5 text-xs text-slate-900 placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-indigo-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-600 font-sans leading-relaxed\\\"\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"tabular-nums\\\">\\n                      {pastedResume.trim().length} characters\\n                    </span>\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={handleUseSampleResume}\\n                      className=\\\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700 underline underline-offset-2 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Insert Sample Resume Text\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {fileError && (\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50/70 p-3 text-xs text-red-700\\\">\\n                      <AlertCircle className=\\\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-red-600\\\" />\\n                      <span>{fileError}</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Right Column: Job Description Section */}\\n            <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-2xs space-y-5\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div>\\n                  <h2 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                    2. Target Job Description\\n                  </h2>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    Paste the job description you want to match against\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={handleUseSampleJob}\\n                  className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:border-indigo-300 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <ClipboardList className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span>Insert Sample Job</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                  <textarea\\n                    rows={9}\\n                    value={jobDescription}\\n                    onChange={(e) => {\\n                      setJobDescription(e.target.value);\\n                      setJobError(null);\\n                      setSubmittedSuccess(false);\\n                    }}\\n                    placeholder={`Paste Job Description here...\\\\n\\\\ne.g., We are seeking a Junior Software Engineer with a solid foundation in React, TypeScript, and REST APIs. Responsibilities include building responsive UI, collaborating with product managers, and deploying services...`}\\n                    className={`w-full rounded-xl border p-3.5 text-xs text-slate-900 placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 leading-relaxed ${\\n                      jobError\\n                        ? \'border-red-300 focus:border-red-500 focus:ring-red-500\'\\n                        : \'border-slate-300 focus:border-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-600\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"tabular-nums\\\">\\n                    {jobDescription.trim().length} characters\\n                  </span>\\n                  {jobDescription.trim().length > 0 && (\\n                    <button\\n                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                      onClick={() => setJobDescription(\'\')}\\n                      className=\\\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Clear\\n                    </button>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Job Error Message */}\\n                {jobError && (\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50/70 p-3 text-xs text-red-700 animate-in fade-in duration-150\\\">\\n                    <AlertCircle className=\\\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-red-600\\\" />\\n                    <span>{jobError}</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Action Bar & Prominent Button */}\\n          <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-2xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-1 text-center sm:text-left\\\">\\n              <h3 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                Ready to Evaluate Fit?\\n              </h3>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n                {!hasResumeInput && !hasJobInput\\n                  ? \'Please provide your resume and target job description above.\'\\n                  : !hasResumeInput\\n                  ? \'Please provide your resume (PDF upload or pasted text).\'\\n                  : !hasJobInput\\n                  ? \'Please paste a target job description.\'\\n                  : \'All inputs validated. Click below to analyze your match.\'}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={handleResetForm}\\n                disabled={!uploadedFile && !pastedResume && !jobDescription}\\n                className=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              >\\n                <RotateCcw className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Reset</span>\\n              </button>\\n\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n                disabled={!isFormValid || isSubmitting}\\n                className=\\\"flex-1 sm:flex-none inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-indigo-700 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-indigo-500/20 active:scale-[0.98] disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              >\\n                {isSubmitting ? (\\n                  <>\\n                    <div className=\\\"h-4 w-4 animate-spin rounded-full border-2 border-white border-t-transparent\\\" />\\n                    <span>Validating Inputs...</span>\\n                  </>\\n                ) : (\\n                  <>\\n                    <Sparkles className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                    <span>Analyze My Match</span>\\n                    <ArrowRight className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n                  </>\\n                )}\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        {/* Privacy Notice Box */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-10 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-slate-50/70 p-4 sm:p-5\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-start gap-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700\\\">\\n              <ShieldCheck className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n              <h4 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-900\\\">\\n                Privacy Notice\\n              </h4>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\\\">\\n                Resumes may contain sensitive personal data such as contact numbers, residential locations, and educational history. In this current preview phase, your files and pasted text are handled client-side within your browser session and are never transmitted to unauthorized third parties. Secure parsing protocols will be implemented when the AI engine is integrated.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create ResumeAnalysisPage component fulfilling all requirements including PDF drag-and-drop, text paste alternative, job description validation, prominent button, and privacy notice\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/ResumeAnalysisPage.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating ResumeAnalysisPage component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create src/components/ResumeAnalysisPage.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
