  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining App Component**\n\nI\'m now diving into `src/App.tsx` and pinpointing its requirements. The component currently needs a `currentPage` state variable, constrained to the `\'home\'`, `\'dashboard\'`, or `\'analyze\'` string literals. I\'m also adding a `handleNavigateAnalyze` function to manage the navigation to the analyze page, potentially accepting a `role` argument.\n\n\n**Refining Component Structure**\n\nI\'m now focusing on how the component renders based on `currentPage`. I\'m checking the specific components rendered based on the state variable: `<Hero>`, `<Features>`, `<DashboardPage>`, and `<ResumeAnalysisPage>`. The navbar, footer, and navigation handlers are also integrated based on current `currentPage` state. I\'m also considering the future of `AnalyzeModal` and whether it is still needed.\n\n\n**Confirming Page Design**\n\nI\'ve determined that keeping `ResumeAnalysisPage` is the best approach to ensure that all requirements are met. It directly addresses the request to create the resume analysis page and incorporate the design specifications. The page will include the heading and subtitle, navigation, and a responsive layout. I\'m focusing on the drag-and-drop area, PDF file validation, and the alternative text input. I will integrate the job description area and the \'Analyze My Match\' button next.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3898020"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n */\\n\\nimport React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Navbar } from \'./components/Navbar\';\\nimport { Hero } from \'./components/Hero\';\\nimport { Features } from \'./components/Features\';\\nimport { Footer } from \'./components/Footer\';\\nimport { DashboardPage } from \'./components/DashboardPage\';\\nimport { ResumeAnalysisPage } from \'./components/ResumeAnalysisPage\';\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const [currentPage, setCurrentPage] = useState<\'home\' | \'dashboard\' | \'analyze\'>(\'home\');\\n  const [targetRoleContext, setTargetRoleContext] = useState<string | undefined>(undefined);\\n\\n  const handleNavigateHome = () => {\\n    setCurrentPage(\'home\');\\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleNavigateDashboard = () => {\\n    setCurrentPage(\'dashboard\');\\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleNavigateAnalyze = (role?: string) => {\\n    setTargetRoleContext(role);\\n    setCurrentPage(\'analyze\');\\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleExploreFeatures = () => {\\n    if (currentPage !== \'home\') {\\n      setCurrentPage(\'home\');\\n      setTimeout(() => {\\n        const el = document.getElementById(\'features\');\\n        if (el) el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n      }, 50);\\n    } else {\\n      const el = document.getElementById(\'features\');\\n      if (el) el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen bg-white text-slate-900 selection:bg-indigo-100 selection:text-indigo-900 flex flex-col font-sans antialiased\\\">\\n      {/* Top Navigation Bar */}\\n      <Navbar\\n        currentPage={currentPage}\\n        onNavigateHome={handleNavigateHome}\\n        onNavigateDashboard={handleNavigateDashboard}\\n        onNavigateAnalyze={() => handleNavigateAnalyze()}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Main Content Area */}\\n      <main className=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n        {currentPage === \'home\' && (\\n          <>\\n            {/* Landing Page Hero Section */}\\n            <Hero\\n              onAnalyzeClick={() => handleNavigateAnalyze()}\\n              onExploreClick={handleExploreFeatures}\\n            />\\n\\n            {/* Feature Cards Section */}\\n            <Features onSelectFeature={() => handleNavigateAnalyze()} />\\n          </>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {currentPage === \'dashboard\' && (\\n          /* Dedicated Student Career Dashboard Page */\\n          <DashboardPage\\n            onOpenAnalyze={(role) => handleNavigateAnalyze(role)}\\n            onNavigateHome={handleNavigateHome}\\n          />\\n        )}\\n\\n        {currentPage === \'analyze\' && (\\n          /* Dedicated Resume Analysis Page */\\n          <ResumeAnalysisPage\\n            onNavigateDashboard={handleNavigateDashboard}\\n            onNavigateHome={handleNavigateHome}\\n            initialRole={targetRoleContext}\\n          />\\n        )}\\n      </main>\\n\\n      {/* Reusable Simple Footer */}\\n      <Footer\\n        onNavigateAnalyze={() => handleNavigateAnalyze()}\\n        onNavigateDashboard={handleNavigateDashboard}\\n        onNavigateHome={handleNavigateHome}\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Update App.tsx to wire ResumeAnalysisPage, DashboardPage, and Landing Page under seamless client-side page state\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating App.tsx\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update src/App.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
