    response: "The **Resume Analysis page** for **SkillBridge AI** is fully integrated, responsive, and error-free:\n\n### 1. Page Design & Typography\n- **Heading**: `\"Analyze Your Career Fit\"`\n- **Subtitle**: `\"Discover how your skills align with your dream role.\"`\n- Clean white background, structured surfaces, and indigo/violet brand accents adhering to the universal design system.\n\n### 2. Resume Upload & Input Section\n- **Drag-and-Drop Area**: Allows dragging or browsing for resume files.\n- **PDF-Only Validation**: Strictly validates `.pdf` files. If an invalid file format is selected, a helpful error message (`\"Invalid file format. Please upload a PDF file only (.pdf).\"`) is displayed.\n- **File Metadata & Removal**: Displays the file name, formatted size (e.g. `1.42 MB`), and an accessible remove button (`X`) to clear or replace the file.\n- **Pasted Text Alternative**: Includes a toggle to switch to **\"Paste Text\"** mode with live character counting and a 1-click **\"Insert Sample Resume Text\"** option for quick testing.\n- **Requirement Rule**: Enforces that at least one resume input (PDF or pasted text) is present.\n\n### 3. Job Description Section\n- **Label**: Explicitly labeled **\"Paste Job Description\"**.\n- **Placeholder**: Pre-populated with an illustrative Junior Full-Stack Developer job description.\n- **Sample Helper**: Includes an **\"Insert Sample Job\"** quick action button.\n- **Validation**: Enforces that the job description is not empty before enabling submission.\n\n### 4. \"Analyze My Match\" Button & Staging Flow\n- **Prominent CTA**: Styled in indigo with active hover and focus rings.\n- **Disabled State**: Button is automatically disabled with visual feedback (`disabled:opacity-50`) until both a resume input and a job description are provided.\n- **Loading Indicator**: Shows an animated spinner and `\"Validating Inputs...\"` during submission.\n- **Temporary Confirmation Message**: After submission, displays:\n  > *\"Resume and Job Description Received: Your inputs have been verified and staged. The analysis engine will be connected in the next development step to extract competencies, match qualifications, and calculate job readiness.\"*\n- No simulated AI scores or fake analysis results are generated.\n\n### 5. Privacy & User Experience\n- **Privacy Notice**: Informs students that resumes may contain personal contact info and that all data remains strictly in their browser session for this preview step.\n- **Responsive Navigation**: Full support for switching between **Home**, **Dashboard**, and **Analyze Resume** across mobile and desktop."
    thinking: "**Verifying Implementation**\n\nI\'ve ensured everything compiles and lints cleanly. I\'ve also confirmed that I\'ve integrated the design\'s white, indigo, and violet scheme. The heading \"Analyze Your Career Fit\" has also been added, as well as the initial portion of the new subtitle, \"Discover how your skills align with...\".\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "The **Resume Analysis page** for **SkillBridge AI** is fully integrated, responsive, and error-free:\n\n### 1. Page Design & Typography\n- **Heading**: `\"Analyze Your Career Fit\"`\n- **Subtitle**: `\"Discover how your skills align with your dream role.\"`\n- Clean white background, structured surfaces, and indigo/violet brand accents adhering to the universal design system.\n\n### 2. Resume Upload & Input Section\n- **Drag-and-Drop Area**: Allows dragging or browsing for resume files.\n- **PDF-Only Validation**: Strictly validates `.pdf` files. If an invalid file format is selected, a helpful error message (`\"Invalid file format. Please upload a PDF file only (.pdf).\"`) is displayed.\n- **File Metadata & Removal**: Displays the file name, formatted size (e.g. `1.42 MB`), and an accessible remove button (`X`) to clear or replace the file.\n- **Pasted Text Alternative**: Includes a toggle to switch to **\"Paste Text\"** mode with live character counting and a 1-click **\"Insert Sample Resume Text\"** option for quick testing.\n- **Requirement Rule**: Enforces that at least one resume input (PDF or pasted text) is present.\n\n### 3. Job Description Section\n- **Label**: Explicitly labeled **\"Paste Job Description\"**.\n- **Placeholder**: Pre-populated with an illustrative Junior Full-Stack Developer job description.\n- **Sample Helper**: Includes an **\"Insert Sample Job\"** quick action button.\n- **Validation**: Enforces that the job description is not empty before enabling submission.\n\n### 4. \"Analyze My Match\" Button & Staging Flow\n- **Prominent CTA**: Styled in indigo with active hover and focus rings.\n- **Disabled State**: Button is automatically disabled with visual feedback (`disabled:opacity-50`) until both a resume input and a job description are provided.\n- **Loading Indicator**: Shows an animated spinner and `\"Validating Inputs...\"` during submission.\n- **Temporary Confirmation Message**: After submission, displays:\n 